  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845744,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## -8 (マイナスエイト) Synopsis\n\nDive into the unique world of *–8* (pronounced “minus eight”), a captivating otome game collaboration from Otomate, Rejet, and Nico Nico Douga, exclusively for PlayStation Portable. Set within Mogura Gakuen, also known as Z Gakuen – a school for students grappling with feelings of shame – the story unfolds when the school faces imminent closure. To save it, the students must find love.\n\nYou play as Yaotome Rei, a student who unfortunately attracts misfortune and a string of “incomplete” young men, each missing a vital piece of themselves. As Rei navigates this unusual environment, she must choose a partner and, through her love, help them overcome their inner struggles and transform “shame” into “love.”\n\n*–8* blends charming characters with a heartwarming narrative, exploring themes of acceptance and self-discovery. Featuring a compelling storyline, beautiful visuals, and a memorable soundtrack including opening theme \"Kimi Zensen (ONLY) HERO!!!\" and ending theme \"Beginning of Love,\" this romance adventure offers a truly special gaming experience. Originally slated for December 2013, *–8* was released on January 23, 2"
    },
